ame␀status␀$id␀␀PreStocks␀status␀2063623768535363940␀{}",u:1789915176121,s:"success",l:$R[7]={articleDocument:null,conversationOptions:$R[8]={rankingMode:void 0},emitTweetSchema:!1,metadata:$R[9]={authorAvatarUrl:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1949867878813159424/Or6qprAH_normal.jpg",authorDescription:void 0,authorName:"PreStocks",focalTweetId:"2063623768535363940",hasArticle:!1,headMetadata:$R[10]={appLinkUrl:"twitter://status?id=2063623768535363940",articleTags:void 0,author:$R[11]={image:$R[12]={alt:"PreStocks profile picture",url:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1949867878813159424/Or6qprAH_400x400.jpg"},screenName:"PreStocks",url:"https://x.com/PreStocks"},bodyText:"ℹ️ SpaceX PreStocks: What Happens After IPO\n\nSpaceX goes public on June 12.\n\nHere’s what $SPACEX holders can expect:\n\n🔁 After IPO, $SPACEX become convertible into a tokenized public stock equivalent.\n\n🔗 Conversion happens through normal trading and is fully onchain. No KYC required.\n\n✂️ The 5-for-1 stock split will be accounted for.\n\n🔒 Like most private shares, SpaceX has a mandatory post-IPO lockup. In this case, the underlying shares unlock in tranches over the first 6 months.\n\n⏳ During the lockup period: because underlying shares are still locked, liquidity is temporarily limited and $SPACEX trades at a discount to the public stock price. The discount is priced by the market and likely narrows as underlying shares unlock over the 6 months. Holders can sell at this discount and new buyers can buy in at this discount.\n\n🔓 After the lockup period: with underlying shares fully unlocked, $SPACEX converts 1:1 into the tokenized public stock equivalent (before liquidity provider fees), with no lockup discount.\n\n⏰ SpaceX PreStocks ($SPACEX) conversion deadline: 11:59pm UTC on March 12, 2027.\n\n⏰ xAI PreStocks ($XAI) conversion deadline: 11:59pm UTC on September 12, 2026 (conversion into $SPACEX at a 1-to-0.1433 ratio, available since February).\n\n🚨 After these conversion deadlines, these tokens will expire worthless and no longer be supported.",canonicalPath:"/PreStocks/status/2063623768535363940",canonicalUrl:"https://x.com/PreStocks/status/2063623768535363940",description:"ℹ️ SpaceX PreStocks: What Happens After IPO\n\nSpaceX goes public on June 12.\n\nHere’s what $SPACEX holders can expect:\n\n🔁 After IPO, $SPACEX become convertible into a tokenized public stock equivalent.\n\n🔗 Conversion happens through normal trading and is fully onchain. No KYC required.\n\n✂️ The 5-for-1 stock split will be accounted for.\n\n🔒 Like most private shares, SpaceX has a mandatory post-IPO lockup. In this case, the underlying shares unlock in tranches over the first 6 months.\n\n⏳ During the lockup period: because underlying shares are still locked, liquidity is temporarily limited and $SPACEX trades at a discount to the public stock price. The discount is priced by the market and likely narrows as underlying shares unlock over the 6 months. Holders can sell at this discount and new buyers can buy in at this discount.\n\n🔓 After the lockup period: with underlying shares fully unlocked, $SPACEX converts 1:1 into the tokenized public stock equivalent (before liquidity provider fees), with no lockup discount.\n\n⏰ SpaceX PreStocks ($SPACEX) conversion deadline: 11:59pm UTC on March 12, 2027.\n\n⏰ xAI PreStocks ($XAI) conversion deadline: 11:59pm UTC on September 12, 2026 (conversion into $SPACEX at a 1-to-0.1433 ratio, available since February).\n\n🚨 After these conversion deadlines, these tokens will expire worthless and no longer be supported.",faviconUrl:void 0,hasAiGeneratedMedia:void 0,image:$R[13]={alt:"PreStocks profile picture",height:400,isContent:!1,preloadUrl:void 0,preloadSrcSet:void 0,preloadSizes:void 0,url:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1949867878813159424/Or6qprAH_400x400.jpg",width:400},isAdult:!1,isArticle:!1,schemaAuthor:$R[14]={"@type":"Person",alternateName:"PreStocks",identifier:"899389893385699328",image:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1949867878813159424/Or6qprAH_400x400.jpg",name:"PreStocks",url:"https://x.com/PreStocks"},mediaPreviewImageUrl:void 0,publishedTime:"2026-06-07T14:07:01.000Z",replyCount:55,socialTitle:"PreStocks (@PreStocks) on X",title:"PreStocks on X: \"ℹ️ SpaceX PreStocks: What Happens After IPO\n\nSpaceX goes public on June 12.\n\nHere’s what $SPACEX holders can expect:\n\n🔁 After IPO, $SPACEX become convertible into a tokenized public stock equivalent.\n\n🔗 Conversion happens through normal trading and is fully onchain. No KYC required.\n\n✂️ The 5-for-1 stock split will be accounted for.\n\n🔒 Like most private shares, SpaceX has a mandatory post-IPO lockup. In this case, the underlying shares unlock in tranches over the first 6 months.\n\n⏳ During the lockup period: because underlying shares are still locked, liquidity is temporarily limited and $SPACEX trades at a discount to the public stock price. The discount is priced by the market and likely narrows as underlying shares unlock over the 6 months. Holders can sell at this discount and new buyers can buy in at this discount.\n\n🔓 After the lockup period: with underlying shares fully unlocked, $SPACEX converts 1:1 into the tokenized public stock equivalent (before liquidity provider fees), with no lockup discount.\n\n⏰ SpaceX PreStocks ($SPACEX) conversion deadline: 11:59pm UTC on March 12, 2027.\n\n⏰ xAI PreStocks ($XAI) conversion deadline: 11:59pm UTC on September 12, 2026 (conversion into $SPACEX at a 1-to-0.1433 ratio, available since February).\n\n🚨 After these conversion deadlines, these tokens will expire worthless and no longer be supported.\""},replyCount:55,screenName:"PreStocks",status:"available",text:"ℹ️ SpaceX PreStocks: What Happens After IPO\n\nSpaceX goes public on June 12.\n\nHere’s what $SPACEX holders can expect:\n\n🔁 After IPO, $SPACEX become convertible into a tokenized public stock equivalent.\n\n🔗 Conversion happens through normal trading and is fully onchain. No KYC required.\n\n✂️ The 5-for-1 stock split will be accounted for.\n\n🔒 Like most private shares, SpaceX has a mandatory post-IPO lockup. In this case, the underlying shares unlock in tranches over the first 6 months.\n\n⏳ During the lockup period: because underlying shares are still locked, liquidity is temporarily limited and $SPACEX trades at a discount to the public stock price. The discount is priced by the market and likely narrows as underlying shares unlock over the 6 months. Holders can sell at this discount and new buyers can buy in at this discount.\n\n🔓 After the lockup period: with underlying shares fully unlocked, $SPACEX converts 1:1 into the tokenized public stock equivalent (before liquidity provider fees), with no lockup discount.\n\n⏰ SpaceX PreStocks ($SPACEX) conversion deadline: 11:59pm UTC on March 12, 2027.\n\n⏰ xAI PreStocks ($XAI) conversion deadline: 11:59pm UTC on September 12, 2026 (conversion into $SPACEX at a 1-to-0.1433 ratio, available since February).\n\n🚨 After these conversion deadlines, these tokens will expire worthless and no longer be supported."},isSinglePost:!1},ssr:!0}],dehydratedData:$R[15]={relayRecords:$R[16]={"client:root":$R[17]={__id:"client:root",__typename:"__Root","tweet_result_by_rest_id(rest_id:\"2063623768535363940\",safety_level:\"TweetDetail\")":$R[18]={__ref:"TweetResults:2063623768535363940"}},"TweetResults:2063623768535363940":$R[19]={__id:"TweetResults:2063623768535363940",__typename:"TweetResults",rest_id:"2063623768535363940",result:$R[20]={__ref:"VHdlZXQ6MjA2MzYyMzc2ODUzNTM2Mzk0MA=="},id:"VHdlZXRSZXN1bHRzOjIwNjM2MjM3Njg1MzUzNjM5NDA="},"VHdlZXQ6MjA2MzYyMzc2ODUzNTM2Mzk0MA==":$R[21]={__id:"VHdlZXQ6MjA2MzYyMzc2ODUzNTM2Mzk0MA==",__typename:"Tweet",article:null,id:"VHdlZXQ6MjA2MzYyMzc2ODUzNTM2Mzk0MA==",rest_id:"2063623768535363940",core:$R[22]={__ref:"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA2MzYyMzc2ODUzNTM2Mzk0MA==:core"},legacy:$R[23]={__ref:"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA2MzYyMzc2ODUzNTM2Mzk0MA==:legacy"},counts:$R[24]={__ref:"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA2MzYyMzc2O